  "display_title": "My Beloved Lucien",
  "description": "Lucien, the notorious eldest son of House Hevonshire, is suddenly forced into a political marriage after years of scandalous behavior disgrace his family. On the eve of the wedding, he indulges in one last night of excess and accepts a drink from a mysterious stranger. Soon after, Lucien loses control of his body and is claimed by a man whose intentions seem anything but coincidental. When morning comes, Lucien is left with fragmented memories, a lingering presence, and the unsettling realization that someone has been waiting for him far longer than he ever knew.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
